Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?SystemUI:=20Bud=C3=ADk=20lock=20screen=20clock?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20and=20shortcuts?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Lock screen on phones (export/mockups 01_lock, behaviour like iOS):
- the clock stays large above the media and the notifications instead
  of the Pixel switch to a small clock: the date, the time in Schibsted
  Grotesk (tabular figures, shrinks only to fit the width) and the next
  alarm; dark text on wallpapers that support dark text, white on the
  others (the lock wallpaper colours); time from the time tick, time,
  time zone and screen on broadcasts, the alarm from NextAlarmController;
  burn-in aware like the clock it replaces;
- the flashlight / camera shortcuts are keycaps (hard 0 x 3 dp shadow,
  mint while on) instead of blurred circles.
The wide layout (tablets, split shade) is unchanged.
